<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks fall 2.24 percent by 0308 GMT.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks fall 2.24 percent by 0308 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai stocks fell 2.24 percent shortly after the open on Monday as foreign investors sold on concerns surrounding the baht's continuing slide against the dollar, brokers said.</p>
<p>The market dropped 14.05 points or 2.24 percent to 614.50 by 0308 GMT. The SET 50 dipped 1.40 points to 45.72.</p>
